{"id":"n23117-1-10","stage":4,"title":"공문 · 公文","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23117-1-10-1","ko":"혹시 공문 받으셨나요?","zh":"您有收到正式文件吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"공문","meaning":"公文","explanation":"공문：公文","readings":[{"term":"공문","audio":"/audio/09b0af75c2f621090745.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23117","senseId":"1","lemma":"공문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공문","audio":"/audio/09b0af75c2f621090745.mp3"}},{"text":"받으셨나요?","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받으셨나요","audio":"/audio/7f71e207f5a0ddba9570.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"09b0af75c2f62109","term":"공문","zh":"公文","audio":"/audio/09b0af75c2f621090745.mp3","entryId":"23117","definition":"有关公共机构或团体事务的、按照特定的体式形成的正式文件。","pronunciation":["공문"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3af023064274fdee5fe9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23117-1-10-2","ko":"공공 기관에서 저희 쪽으로 보낸 서류가 없는데요.","zh":"公共机构应该没有寄给我们方的任何文件啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공공","meaning":"公共","explanation":"공공：公共","readings":[{"term":"공공","audio":"/audio/5feb795ccc17815b35db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25403","senseId":"1","lemma":"공공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공공","audio":"/audio/5feb795ccc17815b35db.mp3"}},{"text":"기관에서","meaning":"机关","explanation":"기관：机关；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"기관","audio":"/audio/5d78ce2d4d5f697d5065.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32482","senseId":"2","lemma":"기관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기관에서","audio":"/audio/a5f50765e78c5dbf2448.mp3"}},{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"쪽으로","meaning":"边","explanation":"쪽：边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58147","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쪽으로","audio":"/audio/dc96c51490b43cf38df8.mp3"}},{"text":"보낸","meaning":"发送","explanation":"보내다：发送；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"10","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보낸","audio":"/audio/246415f22c4e6f2a2bfb.mp3"}},{"text":"서류가","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서류가","audio":"/audio/38a0c8232574d862f703.mp3"}},{"text":"없는데요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는데요","audio":"/audio/33167b1daabf6bb5b81d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5feb795ccc17815b","term":"공공","zh":"公共","audio":"/audio/5feb795ccc17815b35db.mp3","entryId":"25403","definition":"一个国家或社会全体成员都有关联的。","pronunciation":["공공"]},{"id":"5d78ce2d4d5f697d","term":"기관","zh":"机关","audio":"/audio/5d78ce2d4d5f697d5065.mp3","entryId":"32482","definition":"在社会生活中起到一定作用或为实现目的而设立的机构或组织。","pronunciation":["기관"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"077b6c57af048c3b","term":"쪽","zh":"边","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3","entryId":"58147","definition":"进行或朝向的方向。","pronunciation":["쪽"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"发送","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"使内容被传达。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/70dc40d28cbf6b7ec817.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.896,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23117","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您有收到正式文件吗？","公共机构应该没有寄给我们方的任何文件啊。","我不知道我的银行卡里还有多少钱。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您有收到正式文件吗？","公共机构应该没有寄给我们方的任何文件啊。","我不知道我的银行卡里还有多少钱。"],"answer":1}]}
